390 why: "Texans to win\n\nBet Texans\n\n95% chance to win\n\n+10–20% est. return\n\nPays 1.16x\nPolymarket US price, incl. its fee\n\nFri 1:15 AM · Closed\n\nCheck your state\nBet on Polymarket US\nBet only what you can afford to lose.\nCheck\nHow to bet this\nWhy this bet?\nIf you bet $\n\nIf it wins you get $11.60 back ($10 + $1.60)\n\nValue\nGood value\nGood value: an estimated return of 20% or more on fewer past bets, or 10% or more backed by 100+ similar past bets.\nOur estimate\nWins 95% of the time (rounded down)\nPays\n1.16x after the fee\nPrice 85% plus Polymarket US's 1.4% fee\nEstimated return\n+10–20%\nFree shows a range. Win chance × payout, minus the stake, at today's price after the fee. Per bet, on average; any single bet can lose. Based on about 130 similar past bets in NFL match-winner bets.\nSimilar past bets in testing\nBest bets paying under 1.5x before the fee: +12% over over 13 thousand tested bets, won 92%\nLive record so far\nNo settled bets yet\nBest bets are logged when shown and graded as their markets settle.\nHow sure we are\nPlenty of history: based on about 130 similar past bets in NFL match-winner bets\nFull details"
